summary:
  A cached picture that does not say what it is of is painted anyway.

history:
  Every entry is filed with its kind. One without, or with a word that is
  no kind, cannot be shown honestly, and the old shape of an entry was
  exactly that: an address and a time. Such an entry is looked up again.
  This mutant paints it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
          if (hit.url !== "" && SearchLogic.artKind(hit.kind) === "") return false;

replace:
          if (hit.url !== "" && SearchLogic.artKind(hit.kind) === "") hit.kind = "track";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artworkengine.qml::test_a_cache_entry_without_a_kind_is_looked_up_again.
  Line-neutral.
